_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 83
---
order: 83
---
short_label: X.83
---
statement: To a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole only one straight line can be annexed which is incommensurable in square with the whole straight line and which with the whole straight line makes the sum of squares on them medial but twice the rectangle contained by them rational.
